#. Description of the plugin
#: events-certificates.php
msgid "Attendance certificates for meetups, courses and WordCamps, with an optional code and QR code anyone can verify. Participants typed, pasted, from a Meetup CSV, GatherPress or WordCamp.org's CampTix."
msgstr ""

